            "review_text": "Salsfj\nMelbourne, Australia81 contributions\n0\nLovely Vietnamese Food\nDec 2025 • Solo\nActually I needed a place to eat and rest from all the walking around. I'm glad I found Bep Nha. Lovely food! I couldn't finish everything so they packed the spring rolls for me to take home! Very friendly staff. A great place to sit and watch the evening lights. They have indoor and outside seating.\nWritten January 11, 2026",
