            "review_text": "Simon P\nSheffield, United Kingdom205 contributions\n1\nVery average. Uninterested service\nApr 2025 • Couples\nUnfortunately not worth the rating\n\nFood ok but nothing special. The steamed fish was tasty but the other dishes average at best. Coconut prawn was ok but not meaty prawns as eaten elsewhere. Crab rice very dry and you hunted for the crab. \n\nIt was the service that let the whole thing down. 2 ladies casually dressed found it hard to even look at you. The younger waiters just on phones or joking around. \n\nI’d advise to pass on this one unfortunately\nRead more\nWritten April 21, 2025",
