            "review_text": "Ulyana\nAlmaty, Kazakhstan6276 contributions\n0\nTasty, big portions, works during lunch\nJan 2024 • Couples\nThis is a typical viet place with local dishes and fresh seafood as well. Big portions, everything was tasty.\nThere are different fresh juices and smoothies in menu, but actually there are only couple of them are available: watermelon, mango and orange. There is wine by bottles in menu.\nThere are a lot of places tagged “opened” daily, but actually all of them are closed -THIS one really WORKS in a LUNCH time. \nWi-fi is available for guests.\nRead more\nWritten February 9, 2024",
